                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts901" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts909">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>At the point of our lives where, I mean, it took us both quite by surprise when we found each other, but we welcomed it. We were both on the same page.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
