            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a718"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts736" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts738">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And I'm holding it in a little bit.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a719"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts748" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts755">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Okay, it's okay. Do you want to I'll go next. I'll give you a moment, yeah.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a720"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts757" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts766">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>You're still so pretty when you cry.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a721"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts776" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts786">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I mean, apart from the obvious of getting married and having kids, which definitely is up there, and probably the one. But to maybe mix it up a bit, I'd love, as I said, we haven't had enough of a chance to do the things that I think most couples would do in their early years.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a723"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts788" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts800">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I'd love for us to have uh it doesn't have to be long-term travelling or anything, we can't do that, we have cat children. Um but I would love for us to be able to maybe have one really good big adventure.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a725"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts802" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts808">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Before we do potentially look at starting a family, because that's going to take a long time, may be really difficult, may be easy.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a726"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts810" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts811">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>That's what I would really love for us to do.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a727"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts812" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts813">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And if one day we do have a family or tell our family friends, we have something really</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a729"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts814" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts816">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>fun to talk about.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a730"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts818" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts824">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I hear about your mum talking about her and her dad and all of their adventures and stuff. And it made me think.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a732"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts825" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts830">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>All of their adventures and stuff.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a734"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts832" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts834">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>It made me think, I know we've now been on holiday, right?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a735"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts840" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts842">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So much has happened that it hasn't been my timing for a lot of things.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a736"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts844" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts848">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>it'd be good to have more of those things.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a741"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts870" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts871">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a742"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts874" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts875">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Why am I in your life?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a743"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts878" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts879">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Right.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a744"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts880" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts881">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Time went.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a745"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts893" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts894">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Strong</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a746"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts912" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts920">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>We did. We were faster.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a747"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts926" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts930">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Thankfully, we did as well.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
